[Substrike]
format=1
name=Pitched Groan
category=Rumble
author=Substrike
tags=rumble, tonal, dark, playable
description=A tonal 62 Hz kick with a skin on it that follows the keys, and a floor shifted below its note that growls under it. Root C2.
